      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_30_1247-1400",
      "chapterUid": 30,
      "range": "1247-1400",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "成功最可靠的方法， 是你自己定义成功。 先射箭， 然后在射中的地方， 画一个靶心。",
      "totalCount": 13294
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 368813399,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_35_1193-1249",
      "chapterUid": 35,
      "range": "1193-1249",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "了解自身的好方法是， 认真地思考他人身上让你生气的地方。",
      "totalCount": 11312
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 254725362,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_34_1797-1924",
      "chapterUid": 34,
      "range": "1797-1924",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一个很有价值的年度目标是 深入了解一门学科。 一年之后你会惊叹， 一年前你是多么无知。",
      "totalCount": 10764
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 393083394,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_28_1252-1302",
      "chapterUid": 28,
      "range": "1252-1302",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "对一个东西最好的批评 是做出新东西来替代它。",
      "totalCount": 9915
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 903038642,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_31_570-693",
      "chapterUid": 31,
      "range": "570-693",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "新想法产生五分钟后， 就会从你的头脑中消失。 利用这五分钟的时间， 及时行动。",
      "totalCount": 9738
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 584704881,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_29_927-1046",
      "chapterUid": 29,
      "range": "927-1046",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "对已经发生的事进行假设， 是浪费时间。 对未来进行假设， 则大有裨益。",
      "totalCount": 8490
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 903038642,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_31_1142-1235",
      "chapterUid": 31,
      "range": "1142-1235",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "当你陷入困境或力不能支时， 专注在力所能及的小事上， 这能推进事情的进展。",
      "totalCount": 8208
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 383386475,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_35_1724-1862",
      "chapterUid": 35,
      "range": "1724-1862",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "学习的 最好方法是， 试着把你 会的东西 教给别人。",
      "totalCount": 7236
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 903038642,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_30_506-557",
      "chapterUid": 30,
      "range": "506-557",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "要让自己快乐， 就先要让自己成为一个有用之人。",
      "totalCount": 7191
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 419053773,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_30_671-806",
      "chapterUid": 30,
      "range": "671-806",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不要把精美的瓷器和好酒， 非留到难得的场合才拿出来， 这一等可能就是永久； 只要有机会，就可以拿出来。",
      "totalCount": 7038
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 247406859,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_29_742-892",
      "chapterUid": 29,
      "range": "742-892",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "每个月尝试一次， 换条路回家， 换个门进家， 换把椅子吃饭。 不要因循守旧。",
      "totalCount": 7024
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 903038642,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_29_422-502",
      "chapterUid": 29,
      "range": "422-502",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "对每个人， 都要给第二次机会， 但不要给第三次。",
      "totalCount": 6341
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 903038642,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_30_422-471",
      "chapterUid": 30,
      "range": "422-471",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "培养对小事的耐心， 你才能对大事保持耐心。",
      "totalCount": 6066
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 393724257,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_33_2128-2251",
      "chapterUid": 33,
      "range": "2128-2251",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你的生活， 要像一个有待设计的初始模型。 做各种尝试， 而不是制订宏大的计划。",
      "totalCount": 6036
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 408719326,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_30_960-1049",
      "chapterUid": 30,
      "range": "960-1049",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "用你喜爱和接受的东西， 而不是你厌恶和拒绝的东西， 来定义你自己。",
      "totalCount": 5516
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 327260519,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_34_867-912",
      "chapterUid": 34,
      "range": "867-912",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不要用别人的尺子 丈量自己的人生。",
      "totalCount": 5360
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 213652072,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_32_1250-1388",
      "chapterUid": 32,
      "range": "1250-1388",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果你需要旁观者提供紧急帮助， 直接给他们下命令。 给他们分派任务，能让茫然的旁观者， 变成负责任的协助者。",
      "totalCount": 5287
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 26042970,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_36_1338-1463",
      "chapterUid": 36,
      "range": "1338-1463",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你越对别人感兴趣， 别人就越觉得你有趣。 要让自己变得有趣， 就要先对别人感兴趣。",
      "totalCount": 5238
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 393724257,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_33_1151-1338",
      "chapterUid": 33,
      "range": "1151-1338",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "学习如何从与你有分歧 甚至冒犯你的人那里 学到东西。 看看你能不能 从他们的认识中 找到真理。",
      "totalCount": 5070
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300070874",
      "userVid": 570812185,
      "bookmarkId": "3300070874_34_1534-1645",
      "chapterUid": 34,
      "range": "1534-1645",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "旅行的主要目的 是放下。 放下的越多， 你就走得越远。",
      "totalCount": 5049
    }
  ],
